# Documentation Evaluation System

Evaluation system using Lambda Engine operators to assess documentation quality, relevance, and appropriate categorization.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Reviewing existing documentation
- Categorizing documentation
- Determining if documentation should be deprecated
- Deciding where documentation should be located
- Evaluating documentation lifecycle

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable evaluation patterns with operator-guided assessment.

