### Trash Decision Matrix

**When to move documentation to trash (`docs/.trash/`):**

| Condition | Examples | Action |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| **Outdated** | Referenced code doesn't exist, decision superseded | Move to trash |
| **Wrong** | Information is incorrect and unfixable | Move to trash |
| **One-time** | Migration complete, completion summary (work done) | Move to trash |
| **Duplicate** | Content duplicated elsewhere, superseded | Move to trash |
| **Irrelevant** | No longer relevant to current project | Move to trash |
| **Temporary** | Temporary guides after task complete | Move to trash |

**Keep Conditions:**
- ✅ Still relevant to current project
- ✅ Information is accurate
- ✅ Provides ongoing value
- ✅ Unique content
- ✅ In correct category

**Trash Conditions:**
- ❌ No longer relevant
- ❌ Information is wrong and unfixable
- ❌ One-time use (task complete)
- ❌ Duplicate of other docs
- ❌ No historical value

