## Automated Evaluation

### Evaluation Script Pattern

```bash
# Evaluate document
evaluate_document() {
  local file=$1
  
  echo "📄 Evaluating: $file"
  
  # Step 1: Relevance (Retro)
  check_relevance "$file"
  
  # Step 2: Accuracy (Non)
  check_accuracy "$file"
  
  # Step 3: Value (Ana)
  assess_value "$file"
  
  # Step 4: Completeness (Weave)
  check_completeness "$file"
  
  # Step 5: Duplication (Para + Non)
  check_duplication "$file"
  
  # Step 6: Categorization (Axis)
  check_categorization "$file"
  
  # Generate report
  generate_evaluation_report "$file"
}
```

